    family-names: Xiong
    affiliation: Imperial College London
    email: sx822@ic.ac.uk
repository-code: "https://github.com/Shirleyyyxy1226/CellSeer"
url: "https://cellseer.com"
abstract: >-
  CellSeer is a battery cell testing and cycling analysis dashboard
  (React frontend + FastAPI/PostgreSQL backend) for exploring capacity,
  rate performance, dQ/dV and dV/dQ differential analysis, Coulombic
  efficiency, and hierarchical metadata across large cell datasets.
keywords:
  - battery
  - lithium-ion
  - electrochemistry
  - battery cycling
  - dQ/dV
  - specific capacity
  - data visualization
  - materials science
